{"speciesId":521,"names":{"fr":"Déflaisan","es":"Unfezant","en":"Unfezant","ja":"ケンホロウ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Le mâle intimide ses ennemis avec ses caroncules. La femelle vole mieux que le mâle."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Males swing their head plumage to threaten opponents. The females’ flying abilities surpass those of the males."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le mâle a une parure sur la tête. Ils sont très farouches et ne s’attachent qu’à leur Dresseur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Males have plumage on their heads. They will never let themselves feel close to anyone other than their Trainers."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Males swing the plumage on their heads to threaten others, but females are better at flying."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Males swing the plumage on their heads to threaten others, but females are better at flying."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Le mâle intimide ses ennemis avec ses caroncules. La femelle vole mieux que le mâle."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"El macho amenaza al enemigo meciendo el adorno de su cabeza. Al volar, la hembra es mucho más diestra que el macho."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Males swing their head plumage to threaten opponents. The females’ flying abilities surpass those of the males."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"オスは 頭の 飾りを 揺らして 相手を 威嚇する。 メスの 飛行能力は オスを 上回る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ils sont très farouches et ne s’attachent qu’à leur Dresseur. Les mâles ont une parure sur la tête."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"El macho hace gala de ornamentación en la cabeza. No es dado a hacerse amigo de alguien que no sea su Entrenador."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Males have plumage on their heads. They will never let themselves feel close to anyone other than their Trainers."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"オスは 頭に 飾りを 持つ。 ト